bu denetimle \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor. Burada kullanmak i\u00e7in yeni bir de\u011fi\u015fken olu\u015fturun."],"No compatible variables":["Uyumlu de\u011fi\u015fken yok"],"Add variable":["De\u011fi\u015fken ekle"],"Delete variable":["De\u011fi\u015fkeni sil"],"Unlink variable":["De\u011fi\u015fkenin ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r"],"changed":["de\u011fi\u015fti"],"Select variable":["De\u011fi\u015fken se\u00e7in"],"This variable is no longer compatible with this property. You can clear it or select a different one.":["Bu de\u011fi\u015fken art\u0131k bu \u00f6zellik ile uyumlu de\u011fil. Bunu temizleyebilir veya farkl\u0131 bir tane se\u00e7ebilirsiniz."],"Variable has changed":["De\u011fi\u015fken de\u011fi\u015fti"],"Don't show me again":["Bunu bana yeniden g\u00f6sterme"],"Don't worry - all other changes you make will wait until you publish your site.":["Endi\u015felenmeyin \u2014 yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z di\u011fer t\u00fcm de\u011fi\u015fiklikler, sitenizi yay\u0131nlayana kadar bekleyecektir."],"Changes to variables go live right away.":["De\u011fi\u015fkenlerdeki de\u011fi\u015fiklikler an\u0131nda uygulan\u0131r."],"Variables Manager":["De\u011fi\u015fken y\u00f6neticisi"],"There was a glitch. Try saving your variable again.":["Bir sorun olu\u015ftu. De\u011fi\u015fkeninizi yeniden kaydetmeyi deneyin."],"This variable name already exists. Please choose a unique name.":["Bu de\u011fi\u015fken ad\u0131 zaten var. L\u00fctfen e\u015fsiz bir ad se\u00e7in."],"Keep names up to 50 characters.":["Adlar\u0131 en fazla 50 karakter tutun."],"Names have to include at least one non-special character.":["Adlar en az bir \u00f6zel olmayan karakter i\u00e7ermelidir."],"Use letters, numbers, dashes (-), or underscores (_) for the name.":["Ad i\u00e7in harf, rakam, tire (-) veya alt \u00e7izgi (_) kullan\u0131n."],"Add a value to complete your variable.":["De\u011fi\u015fkeninizi tamamlamak i\u00e7in bir de\u011fer ekleyin."],"Give your variable a name.":["De\u011fi\u015fkeninize bir ad verin."],"Unexpected response from server":["Sunucudan beklenmeyen yan\u0131t"],"Missing variable":["Eksik de\u011fi\u015fken"],"deleted":["silindi"],"With your current role, you can only connect and detach variables.":["Mevcut rol\u00fcn\u00fczle yaln\u0131zca de\u011fi\u015fkenleri ba\u011flayabilir ve ay\u0131rabilirsiniz."],"There are no variables":["De\u011fi\u015fken yok"],"Create a variable":["Bir de\u011fi\u015fken olu\u015fturun"],"Variables are saved attributes that you can apply anywhere on your site.":["De\u011fi\u015fkenler, sitenizin herhangi bir yerinde uygulayabilece\u011finiz kaydedilmi\u015f niteliklerdir."],"Create your first variable":["\u0130lk de\u011fi\u015fkeninizi olu\u015fturun"],"It may have been deleted. Try clearing this field and select a different value or variable.":["Silinmi\u015f olabilir. Bu alan\u0131 temizleyip farkl\u0131 bir de\u011fer veya de\u011fi\u015fken se\u00e7meyi deneyin."],"This variable is missing":["Bu de\u011fi\u015fken eksik"],"has been deleted, but it is still referenced in this location. You may restore the variable or unlink it to assign a different value.":["silindi ancak bu konumda h\u00e2l\u00e2 ba\u015fvuruluyor. Farkl\u0131 bir de\u011fer atamak i\u00e7in de\u011fi\u015fkeni geri y\u00fckleyebilir veya ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131rabilirsiniz."],"The variable":["De\u011fi\u015fken"],"Deleted variable":["Silinen de\u011fi\u015fken"],"will keep their current values, but the variable itself will be removed.":["mevcut de\u011ferlerini korur ancak de\u011fi\u015fkenin kendisi kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r."],"All elements using":["\u015eunu kullanan t\u00fcm \u00f6geler:"],"Delete this variable?":["Bu de\u011fi\u015fken silinsin mi?"],"Create your first %s variable":["\u0130lk %s t\u00fcr\u00fcndeki de\u011fi\u015fkeninizi olu\u015fturun"],"Restore variable":["De\u011fi\u015fkeni geri y\u00fckle"],"Edit variable":["De\u011fi\u015fkeni d\u00fczenle"],"Create variable":["De\u011fi\u015fken olu\u015ftur"],"Value":["De\u011fer"],"To avoid losing your updates, save your changes before leaving.":["G\u00fcncellemelerinizin kaybolmas\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7in, sayfadan ayr\u0131lmadan \u00f6nce de\u011fi\u015fikliklerinizi kaydedin."],"You have unsaved changes":["Kaydedilmemi\u015f de\u011fi\u015fiklikleriniz var"],"Save changes":["De\u011fi\u015fiklikleri kaydet"],"Font family":["Yaz\u0131 tipi ailesi"],"Clear & try again":["Temizle ve yeniden dene"],"Try something else.":["Ba\u015fka bir \u015fey deneyin."],"Variables":["De\u011fi\u015fkenler"],"Sorry, nothing matched":["\u00dczg\u00fcn\u00fcz, hi\u00e7bir \u015fey e\u015fle\u015fmedi"],"There was a glitch.":["Bir aksakl\u0131k oldu."],"Upgrade now":["Hemen y\u00fckselt"],"Take me there":["G\u00f6t\u00fcr beni"],"Got it":["Anlad\u0131m"],"Create":["Olu\u015ftur"],"Restore":["Geri Y\u00fckle"],"Keep editing":["D\u00fczenlemeye devam et"],"Search":["Ara"],"Duplicate":["\u00c7o\u011falt"],"Name":["Ad"],"Go Back":["Geri d\u00f6n"],"Cancel":["\u0130ptal"],"Discard":["G\u00f6zard\u0131 et"],"Save":["Kaydet"],"Delete":["Sil"],"Unlink":["Ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 kald\u0131r"],"Clear":["Temiz"]}},"comment":{"reference":"assets\/js\/packages\/editor-variables\/editor-variables.js"}}